Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.64,Title,0,0,0,0,,《铁血战士2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,热浪还在继续 洛杉矶已高达109华氏度\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heat wave continues. it's 109 degrees in los angeles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶饱受干旱之苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}As drought-ridden los angeles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,高温使人们备受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}swelters in agonising heat, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.93,0:01:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而街头的毒品稽查也在如火如荼的进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}…drug lords wage warfare in the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.35,0:01:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一次公开对抗还在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet another open conflict…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 快带我离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, fuck this! get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两名骑警在火拼中受重伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two motorcycle officers horribly wounded in a crossfire, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方似乎无力解救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police seemingly unable to rescue them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,多次英勇的突围都没有成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}in spite of several desperate, heroic attempts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里已经完全失去控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's completely out of control down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我辛苦经营的酒吧全没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beautiful cantina, everything I own, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.34,0:02:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都被打碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they shot it to pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的微波炉 自动蒸锅 烤箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My microwave, my automatic steamer, my grill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking pendejos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你们他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是托尼·普波 这里是核心现场节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony pope, live with hard core{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为您做现场报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the scene andin yourface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.35,0:03:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就像但丁描写的地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like dante's hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,硝烟 枪声和难以忍受的高温…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoke, fire, oppressive heat, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥伦比亚和牙买加的大烟鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}As colombian and jamaican drug fiends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次把洛杉矶变成了屠宰场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again transform LA into a slaughterhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到底谁说了算 警察吗 非也\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell's in charge down here? the cops?Uh-uh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.28,0:03:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是人数众多 装备精良的笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're outmanned, outgunned and incompetent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在塔霍湖家中度假的市长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr mayor, on vacation in your home in lake tahoe, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把烟头放下 赶快到这来颁布戒严令\N{\fnArial\fs30}…get off your butt, get down here and declare martial law!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我心神不宁 丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, don't keep me in suspense, danny boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天真不太平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has not been a nice day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两辆摩托倒在卡车那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two motors pulled over a truck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好挡住了中间缉毒警的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stumbled right in the middle of a narc stakeout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,十个全副武装的哥伦比亚人就足以对付我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, ten colombians and scorpios armed to fuck all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想回老巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to get in their headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're keeping them pinned down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过那些警察就快因出血过多而死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but those officers are bleeding to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们快不行了 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! they're dying, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的重武器在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is special weapons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们还在圣佩德罗和牙买加人交火\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still tied up in that shootout in san pedro with the jamaicans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们击落了一架直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot down a chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯和詹森快顶不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mills and Johnson won't last much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一辆装甲车去救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need an assault vehicle to go get 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我来想想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna chat with these assholes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.19,0:04:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看我信号 给我火力掩护 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When I give the signal, give me some cover! - Got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快带他们离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em out of here! now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamonos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em out! get 'em out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vamonos! - Vamonos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, assholes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, are you ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 快去抓那些余孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah. let's get the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 海纳曼指挥官有命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't. orders from chief heinemann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says surround building and wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待什么命 - 我怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait for what? - I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是特种部队 联邦探员 毒品管制局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some bullshit special unit. the feds, the dea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果等那帮家伙来插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we let those bastards get dug in now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得将这座房子夷为平地才能抓住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have to level the building to get them out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狗娘养的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hijo de puta. - No, es para mi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamonos!vamonos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venga!aprisa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venga!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it. ei scorpio is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警官 上面有你们的人吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarge, any of your people in the building? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.64,0:08:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉 你不能进去 海纳曼马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, can't let you in. Heinemann's on his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他去死吧 动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heinemann can kiss my sweet ass! come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 跟上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it. go with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back, back, back. back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.65,0:09:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔壁也检查完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next door over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在门口守着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在二楼 有人受伤 请求支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}First floor, officer down. we need backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.57,0:09:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, lay your guns down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是走下来还是跳下去随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can walk down or fly, it's your choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.58,0:09:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但先把枪放下 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said put it down, asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, it's hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是眼花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be losing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,散开 搜查整个屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread out. secure the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy. I'm righthere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报解除 一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear. all clear on the site.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dannyboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get down from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,全面搜查 哪层都不要放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, search the roof. check every floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还有余党\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe someone else…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这里封锁起来 不许任何人离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal it off. no one leaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 快让我离开这鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, get me off this damn roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到他们的同党了吗 - 有人捷足先登了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You get the rest of them? - Somebody beat us to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leona.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened to ei scorpio?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在吃午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out front having lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这究竟是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都身首异处\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been cut to pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是牙买加人\N{\fnArial\fs30}must be the jamaicans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他们的风格 但他们去哪儿了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}their style, but where the hell did they go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,法医来以前 不准任何人进这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, nobody gets in here until forensic arrives. nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道程序的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, you know the drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 你看上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike. Up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是在这儿被杀 然后有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been killed out here, and then someone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码有35到40英尺高 没有绳子和梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about 35, 40 feet. no rope, no ladder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙有190到195磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy weighs about 190, 195 pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不能把他挂在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't carry him up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,副指挥官海纳曼在楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy chief heinemann's downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要你和你的人赶快离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wants you and your people out of the building now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是好兆头 迈克 一点都不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not good, mike. not good at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查查这家伙的底细 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want a real name on this joker, ok? - You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔 你怎么也在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phil, this is quite a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what brings you down from the palace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 你让我很失望 我现在很不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me down, mike. you're making me look bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.43,0:14:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们已经达成共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had an understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我费尽心思让你到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put my ass on the line to get you here, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只希望你能合作一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and all I expect is a little cooperation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你这是联邦调查局的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were told this was a federal matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.48,0:14:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别插手 你竟然违抗命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you disobeyed an order to stay out of the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样说 菲尔 是战争带我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let this get out, phil, but it's a fucking war down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当兵就要服从命令 别找借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers take orders. don't push it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔 我没有找借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll push it as far as I can, phil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们在市区办公室里转铅笔的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}cos we're fighting for our lives here, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这儿冒死战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while you're downtown pushing pencils and kissing ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会听任何人的 特别是联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't roll over for anybody, especially the feds, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非给我们一个好的解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without a goddamn good explanation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些仪器搬去三楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this equipment up to the third floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on, let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 对不起 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Excuse me, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,海纳曼 他们到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here, heinemann?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不听指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insubordination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不服从上级领导的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}disregard for direct orders from a supervising officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚回你阿瓦拉多的窝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get back to your cage at alvarado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你见识见识什么是不听指挥 你个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you insubordination, you son of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑什么 有种过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you running to? come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要这样 迈克 何必呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need this, mike. it's not worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为您带来最新报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an update for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次交火 五名哥伦比亚毒贩\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a shootout, five members of one colombian drug gang…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他们的对手杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}…were ambushed by their bloody rivals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙买加的伏都教徒神秘失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}the jamaican voodoo posse, who escaped withouta trace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.85,0:16:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次愚弄了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}again making total fools of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有位警官想见你 - 在那后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A detective is here to see you. - Back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 女士 你家厕所漏水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, lady, you got a backed-up toilet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要的是水管工而不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call a plumber, not the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的执照过期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This licence has expired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯 我六个月前付过钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit! I paid that fee six months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心我揍你 - 坐下 赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll kick your ass! - Sit down! right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 快走 - 你他妈冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! get your ass movin'! - Just calm the fuck down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you lookin' at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all you got to do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把球放在球座上 然后挥杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is tee it high and let it fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的挥杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! dead solid perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, remember{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看好距离 紧紧地抓住球杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}for distance you gotta gently but firmly grip the club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈里根中尉 我是探员兰伯特 防卫司的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant harrigan! detective lambert, rampart division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子 先坐一会 我一会找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, just have a seat. I'll be right with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.11,0:17:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 头 - 你先别说 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, cap. - Don't start, mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,海纳曼已经警告我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heinemann's already been up my ass so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我小心我头上的乌纱帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far I won't be able to sit down for a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not winning this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你愿不愿意 有些事你必须要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as it'll piss you off, you'll have to play the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.37,0:17:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且必须立即去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}"effective immediately, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.73,0:17:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦特遣队负责人彼得·凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A federal task force under special agent peter keyes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.41,0:17:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,会调查一系列犯罪活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will investigate criminal activities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括一些受限案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Involving the trafficking of controlled substances."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要全力配合他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will extend him your full cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要我把案子交给他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're cutting off my dick and shoving it up my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.56,0:17:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局是老大 我们得听它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feds are calling the shots on this. my hands are tied!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.01,0:17:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮尔格瑞姆上尉 我是彼得·凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain pilgrim, peter keyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 我也是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good to meet you. - And you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克·哈里根中尉 联邦调查局探员彼得·凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant mike harrigan. special agent peter keyes, dea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,久仰大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard a lot about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 这是司法程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for this jurisdictional intrusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说我比你们权力大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mean to be stepping on your toes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想铲除金·威利的伏都教\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we want to prevent king willie's voodoo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们控制了整个西海岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gangs from taking over the entire west coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.25,0:18:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想多透露一些给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could tell you more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这牵涉到一些核心问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have a large number of deep-cover operatives involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道的 我们都有各自的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how it is. we all have a job to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.81,0:18:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会尊重彼此并各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can respect each other's situation and act responsibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作是我突出的个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, …um, cooperation…is my middle name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚调过来 我叫吉瑞·兰伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the new transfer, jerry lambert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你先坐一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个公子哥是谁 - 一个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this dude? - Yeah, what an asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, danny boy, what we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是五个来历不明人\N{\fnArial\fs30}five lowlife scorpions make it into the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.27,0:19:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 他们变成了烤肉串\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next minute… they're all shish kebab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one bullet wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了毒品和钱 因为这些东西撒了一地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't drugs or money. there's a shit load of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.82,0:19:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许金·威利雇了某个厉害角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe king willie brought in some outside talent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正显示他的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making his big move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我们上去之前已经解决了战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pro would have split the moment he heard us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止杀了一个人 也许我们见到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than one, we would have seen them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟是谁在最后时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this waited until the last minute, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,将四个手持机枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then took out four men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍匪统统放倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}armed with machine guns by hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在我们眼皮底下溜走了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then got by us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该雇佣他\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's put him on the payroll.Maybe we should give him a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我和我搭档守在楼梯上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So me and my partner bolt up the stairs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人大叫血腥谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody is screaming bloody murder…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听我说 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gotta… you gotta hear this. - What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 忘了告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. hey, I forgot to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.47,0:19:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见那家伙了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that guy there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会接菲利斯的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ferris's replacement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.73,0:20:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫吉瑞·兰伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's jerry lambert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.69,0:20:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是防卫司的独行侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}the lone ranger from rampart station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有他那样的独行侠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the lone ranger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.61,0:20:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为他是来这儿修空调的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was here to fix the air conditioning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说「女士你被捕了」 她说「为什么」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said "lady, you are under arrest." and she said "why?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.99,0:20:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说「因为你杀死了你丈夫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said "because your husband is dead. you killed him."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道她说什么 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what she said, didn't miss a beat? - uh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说「我以前常常这么刺这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said "i stabbed that son of a bitch plenty of times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.57,0:20:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他都没死啊「\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never died on me before."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像在挑逗利昂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he's putting the moves to leona.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.99,0:20:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他犯的第一个大错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}His first big mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.52,0:20:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比如你上个搭档被枪击 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like your last partner got shot. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别老缠着我 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try that cowboy shit with me, fucker, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然我把你阉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can kiss these goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗 - 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it? - Yeah, I got it. unhh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:21:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你已经见过三位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, I see that the three of you have met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.01,0:21:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰伯特 如果你还忍得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lambert, if you're feeling up to it, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以慢慢地走到中尉那\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why don't you limp your way in to the lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真是个坏女孩 - 我喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a bad girl. - Ooh, I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 这女人是不是来月经了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn, is that bitch on the rag or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子 接下来我所说的就是所谓的「规矩」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I call "the speech", kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只说一次 注意听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only give it once, so pay attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.16,0:21:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止 都是些小打小闹的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until now, it's all been fun and games, cops and robbers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.13,0:21:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有油炸圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dunking doughnuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.42,0:21:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在不一样了 我得告诉你这是个战区\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're in the shit now. metro command is a war zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, I've paid my dues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我费了很多功夫才调到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to bust my ass to get my transfer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.59,0:21:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我很吃惊 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that scares the shit out of me, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会要求到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one requests to come here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他想扬名立万\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless they want a reputation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有地方让人表现自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no room for anyone looking to prove themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.07,0:21:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也绝不允许这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't stand for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要好警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need good cops{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:21:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they say you're good at what you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.61,0:22:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是团队精神是第一位的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the team comes first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.99,0:22:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,以团队为主 才是重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live by that, and you'll be ok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.99,0:22:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll all be there for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.07,0:22:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 凡事都有两面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, the door swings both ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 是不是做的太过火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, guys. this has gone too far now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.12,0:22:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想恐吓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-l-l know you're trying to scare me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did a pretty good job, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.05,0:23:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can pay you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.89,0:23:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,两百万现钞 马上就给\N{\fnArial\fs30}$2 million, man. in cash. right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.81,0:23:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是钱的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not about money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.39,0:23:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是权利之争\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.94,0:23:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里会有新老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new king in the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.23,0:23:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你和你的手下提个醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a message he has for your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.69,0:23:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时代过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的历史 普托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking history, goddamn puto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you doing now, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,金·威利说\N{\fnArial\fs30}King willie says…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不仅能杀死你的肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not only do I have to kill you, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能带走你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I have to take your soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.36,0:24:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏都教的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voodoo magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.73,0:24:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的伏都教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking voodoo magic, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道吗 我来告诉你我的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? I tell you what I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.41,0:24:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.11,0:25:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sh… shit happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.74,0:25:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.38,0:25:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在圣佩德罗的别墅区外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standing just outside a penthouse complex in san pedro…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.39,0:25:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有20人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…involving as many as 20 people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.01,0:25:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者身份不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's uncertain who they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.72,0:26:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有报告指出\N{\fnArial\fs30}One report indicates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是恐怖的牙买加伏都教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be the feared jamaican voodoo posse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.48,0:26:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去做身体检查 我的医生说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go in for my physical and the doctor says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我需要精子 大便和尿样」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"i need a semen, Stool and urine sample."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.77,0:26:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说「医生 我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say "gee, doc, I'm in a big hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.80,0:26:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能只把内裤留下「\N{\fnArial\fs30}can I just leave my underwear?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.05,0:26:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面至少有50具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}there may be as many as 50 more dead bodies up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.95,0:26:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那 是波普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, it's pope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.74,0:26:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个寄生虫肯定住在车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That parasite must live in his car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.87,0:26:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理 公共关系我最拿手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle it. pr's my specialty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.70,0:26:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说让你别沾手这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word is they want your ass off the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.30,0:26:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托尼 伙计 - 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- tony, my man! - who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你最忠实的粉丝 每次都看你的演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your biggest fan! catch your show all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.79,0:26:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还有工作要做 - 你要做的就是滚远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got a job to do! - Your job is to root garbage for elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.08,0:26:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去过了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been inside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.78,0:26:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们几个当时正要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. we were gonna go in with our guys, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.43,0:26:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是接到无线电通知说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were told on a radio{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.89,0:26:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么 任何人都不能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transmission nobody goes in under any circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, be advised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.04,0:26:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查员将接手调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}federal offcers will handle investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.26,0:26:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们什么都没听到 走 - 你是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we didn't hear that. let's go. - you're the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.39,0:26:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢丽尔·泰尔在现场为您报道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is cheryl tyer reporting live…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.77,0:26:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手电筒真不错 介意我借用一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nice flashlight. mind if I borrow it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.17,0:27:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.59,0:27:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很眼熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look familiar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.18,0:27:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.80,0:27:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.35,0:27:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷蒙·维嘉 那个大毒枭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramon vega, the crack king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.85,0:27:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是东洛杉矶最大的贩子 每周卖出100公斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biggest operator in east LA. 100 kils a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.56,0:27:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他没被剥皮 这些混蛋是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't he skinned? and who are they assholes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.22,0:27:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是牙买加人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are jamaicans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.23,0:27:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,金·威利的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}King willie's boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.73,0:27:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.49,0:27:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伏都教仪式 我见过 他们挖出他的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was a voodoo ritual. I've seen it before. they took his heart out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.36,0:27:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了什么 - 都是吓人的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what for? - Terror tactics, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.78,0:27:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了把敌人吓得屁滚尿流\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, to scare the shit out of their enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.41,0:27:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金·威利 - 谁是该死的金·威利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- king willie. - who the hell is king willie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:28:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,金·威利 伏都教洛杉矶分教的神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}King willie, voodoo priest of the LA posses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.75,0:28:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的势力变得强大前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran the terror gangs for Edward seaga in Jamaica…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.01,0:28:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮爱德华·西嘉在牙买加运营恐怖组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}…till he got too powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.09,0:28:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没他允许 牙买加的头头们都不敢有所行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jamaican chiefs won't make a move without his approval.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what the fuck happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we got a survivor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.86,0:28:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.41,0:28:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 听不清她在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. she's not making any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.20,0:28:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直在说「恶魔来找他们了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}She keeps saying "ei diablo vino por ellos." the devil came for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.83,0:28:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是那些哥伦比亚人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's the colombians did this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.15,0:28:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们不管吊着的老大和裸体的女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd they leave their boss hanging and his girl naked on the floor?{\r}
