Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.84,0:39:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶已经唾手可得\N{\fnArial\fs30}LA is up for grabs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.72,0:39:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座曾经美好的城市将落入那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}the spoils of our once fine city going to the ruthless scum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.85,0:39:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,肆意制造屠杀和流血事件的人渣手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can spread the most carnage and blood in our streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.69,0:39:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个混蛋人渣和一名优秀的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five assorted trash and one good cop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.61,0:39:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,警局中最优秀的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the best on our force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.49,0:39:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁将是下一个受害者 而市长又在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's next? where's the mayor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.27,0:39:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至根本就不在洛杉矶…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not even in the city…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.66,0:39:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了他吧 都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.53,0:39:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, god damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.27,0:39:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 这不是你一个人的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't your personal little war, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.71,0:39:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved Danny, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.67,0:39:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我们只有团队作战才能存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you told me the only way you survive is because you're a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.46,0:40:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事都有两面 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door swings both ways. remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.89,0:40:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. we'll do it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.64,0:40:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我一些关于凯斯的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. talk to me about keyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.10,0:40:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去三天我们一直在跟踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've been on him for the last three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.16,0:40:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本就没有找毒贩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're not looking for drug dealers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.40,0:40:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是在全市区安装那些奇怪的雷达探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. they've been setting up weird radar sensors all over downtown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.11,0:40:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用尽了一切办法去跟着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used my whole repertory to keep up with them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.11,0:40:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尝试用探测器扫描他们 但是被他们察觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had scanners on them, but they scrambled my shit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.32,0:40:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的设备太先进 我根本无法靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had equipment I can't begin to touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.78,0:40:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早晨…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then this morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.45,0:40:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我把他们跟丢了 - 我们把他们跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I lost 'em. - We lost them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.12,0:40:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪跟丢的？- 弗农街和工业街街口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lost where? - vernon and lndustry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.29,0:40:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们就像人间蒸发了一样 - 在屠宰区？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean they like fucking disappeared! - the slaughterhouse district?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.34,0:40:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这大热天 我是说 热得能烧烤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and in this heat, whoo! I mean, bo and barbecue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.80,0:40:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管凯斯在找什么 他已找到了 或即将找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}so whatever keyes is looking for, he's found it, or damn close to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.22,0:40:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂娜 我想见金·威利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leona, I want to meet with king willie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.39,0:40:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我和威利有着相同的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie and I seem to have the same problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.68,0:40:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而你 跟我一起走 - 迈克 这无法办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the meantime, you come with me. - Mike, it's impossible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.02,0:40:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.94,0:41:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.15,0:41:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧米加一号 这里是控制中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omega 1. this is control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.65,0:41:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是欧米加一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is omega 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.86,0:41:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有二十二分钟安全作业时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only have 22 minutes on safe window of operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 最后一次检查遥测装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Verify that final telemetry check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.04,0:41:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start your test now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.91,0:41:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟踪扫描 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scan track three, two, one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.67,0:41:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.88,0:41:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,六号 紫外线的正常启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number six, power up on the uv banks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.71,0:41:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,紫外线已经完成 准备好接受测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're complete on the lower uv banks. ready for testing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.84,0:41:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二步 检查周围的温度变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second level, check for ambient temperature variations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.85,0:41:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有两分钟时间 现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got two minutes. now get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.93,0:41:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位\N{\fnArial\fs30}To all units.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.67,0:41:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位 你们有大约20分钟时间完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, you have approximately 20 minutes to finish your task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.94,0:41:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 增加这个紫外线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roger. - Increase this uv.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.11,0:41:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,上升到42%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up 42 per cent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.32,0:41:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友死于利器刺入胸腔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend died as the result of an intrusion in the chest cavity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.24,0:41:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这差点把他的心撕成两半\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by an edged weapon that nearly cleaved the heart in two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.95,0:41:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡是瞬间发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death was instantaneous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.12,0:42:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他全身的骨头都被去掉了 我从未见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was boned like a fish. I've never seen anything like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.21,0:42:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别碰任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, do not touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.26,0:42:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 其他那些受害者的情况怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, what about the other victims?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.59,0:42:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么别的发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.14,0:42:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查组带来了他们自己的法医\N{\fnArial\fs30}The federal team brought in their own forensic examiners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.18,0:42:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这个城市的验尸员和首席病理学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the medical examiner and the chief pathologist in the city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.94,0:42:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们就这么把我完全抛弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they've cut me out completely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.73,0:42:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你能看到他们收集到的证据吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway you can get a look at evidence the feds have collected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.19,0:42:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 他们肯定做过实验 - 这很困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, they must have run tests. - It won't be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.36,0:42:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.53,0:42:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我从丹尼的手里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}l pried this from danny's hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.37,0:42:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是它把丹尼引上了屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what took him into the rafters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.29,0:42:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个几乎没有重量 - 但它却像钢铁一样锋利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It has almost no weight. - But it cuts like steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.08,0:42:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.13,0:42:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们把它放大十五万倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are now at 150, 000 times normal magnification.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.89,0:42:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astonishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.46,0:42:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种元素根本不存在于元素周期表上\N{\fnArial\fs30}This material doesn't correspond to anything on the periodic table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.48,0:43:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 中尉 那到底是什么 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lieutenant, what the hell is that thing? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.21,0:43:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但肯定不是五金店里买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not from a hardware store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.94,0:43:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是军用的吗 - 很好的假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No military? - Uh, good guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.15,0:43:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他们丢的 就是他们想找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either something that got away, or something they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.03,0:43:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯 我们已经离真相很近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keyes. ah, we're getting closer now to what happened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.45,0:43:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.20,0:43:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 小伙子 把你的抢收起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, kid. put your gun away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.41,0:43:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,金·威利要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}King willie will see you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.83,0:43:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 你不想我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's ok. - Don't you want me with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.96,0:43:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后我打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.88,0:43:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想我跟着你吗 - 稍后我打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to follow you? - I'll call you later!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.93,0:43:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,整点大麻怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some ganja, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.06,0:43:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,车牌号\N{\fnArial\fs30}License plate number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.43,0:43:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,1-8-8\N{\fnArial\fs30}1-8-8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.02,0:43:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 1- 8- 8- 3\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. 1-8-8-3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.85,0:43:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.12,0:43:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的「凡事都有两面」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door swings both ways, my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.95,0:44:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿也有两面\N{\fnArial\fs30}This door swings both ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.10,0:44:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢载我一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.10,0:44:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.89,0:44:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在该少抽点烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}you guys really ought to cut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.19,0:45:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你想跟我聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say you want to talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.44,0:45:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还说你在暗中帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say you're offering me favours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.49,0:45:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你这么做的原因 死警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why, babylon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.04,0:45:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr policeman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.96,0:45:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要一些情报 - 情报？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want some information. - information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.63,0:45:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那个杀手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the one that's doing all the killing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.13,0:45:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他先杀了你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.26,0:45:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又来杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.35,0:45:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应该知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.22,0:45:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.39,0:45:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.52,0:45:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.15,0:46:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在另外一个世界 - 你在胡说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The other side. - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.57,0:46:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在灵界中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirit world, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.58,0:46:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.49,0:46:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's always the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.33,0:46:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,该来的还是要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no stopping what can't be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.42,0:46:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的还是要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No killing what can't be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.25,0:46:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别故弄玄虚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, make sense, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.46,0:46:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你跟我的手下的那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing that's killing your people and mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.43,0:46:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自另外一个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}is from the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.60,0:46:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感受到他的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel him all around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.60,0:46:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但除非他来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see the eyes of the demon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.23,0:46:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就无法用肉眼看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}until him come calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.36,0:46:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is dread, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.90,0:46:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly dread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.24,0:46:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没你的事了 警察先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing else for you here, policeman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.21,0:46:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.47,0:47:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.16,0:48:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他的基地在圣山之上」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"his foundation lie in the holy mountain."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.38,0:48:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「西拉」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"selah."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.76,0:49:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是托尼·普波在充满恐惧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is tony pope live from la, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.31,0:49:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶城为您直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}the city of fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.68,0:49:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个变态的杀手还在继续着他每天的屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The psycho-vigilante killer continues his daily diet for murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.56,0:49:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,高挂的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bodies strung out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.31,0:49:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被剥皮的尸体 以及从尸体中挖出的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}bodies with the skins ripped off, the hearts torn from the cadavers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.32,0:49:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而就在刚才 金·威利 那个毒枭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just recently, king willie, the drug lord, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.20,0:49:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个万恶的毒枭 在一条小巷的转角被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the vicious drug lord found in an alley just around the corner…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.70,0:49:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头被砍了下来 而脊椎则被拆散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his head cut off and his spinal column torn from the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.79,0:49:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是死有余辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fitting demise to the prince of powder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.50,0:49:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是丹尼 接着是金·威利 而你恰好都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}First danny, then king willie. and you were right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.38,0:49:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在耍你呢 你得小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's playing with you, mike. you've gotta be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.67,0:49:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们都要小心 凯斯那边怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. we all gotta be careful. what about keyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.55,0:49:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有新发现吗 - 凯斯这有点棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything there? - Definitely something slippery about keyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.77,0:49:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,全名叫彼得·J·凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems there's a peter j keyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.31,0:49:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得了是康奈尔大学的物理学博士学位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phd physical sciences, cornell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.48,0:50:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,以优异的成绩毕业并加入战略防御研究所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot out of college and into the strategic defense lnstitute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.44,0:50:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年后被任命为空军情报部门的上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then two years later commissioned as a captain in air force lntelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.65,0:50:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 我们查不下去了 超过我们范围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, this is a dead end. we're way out of our league!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.41,0:50:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不管他有多大的来头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't care how big this is and who's involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.88,0:50:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了丹尼 他必须付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy killed danny and he's going to fall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.39,0:50:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 医生那边怎么样 - 我在这 中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now whatabout the good doctor? - Yeah, I'm here, lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.65,0:50:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦当局清除了所有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}The federal authorities erased everything from the computer file{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.47,0:50:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.92,0:50:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别墅的木碎片的部分化验结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of a chemical test on a fragment of wood from the penthouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.12,0:50:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它含有微量的牛血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it contained traces…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.00,0:50:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,和大量的类固醇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of cattle blood and heavy traces of steroids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.21,0:50:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为杀死丹尼的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe whoever killed detective{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.60,0:50:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近曾到过屠宰场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had recently been in a slaughterhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.13,0:50:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠宰场 正是我第一次跟丢凯斯的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slaughterhouse.That's where llostkeyes the first time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.76,0:50:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 我们会在那找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. that's where we'll find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.80,0:50:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐地铁过来 一小时后伯恩斯车站见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the metro. I'll pick you up at Burns station in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.39,0:50:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到凯斯的人 不代表他不在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justbecause you don't see keyes's boys doesn't mean they're notaround.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.29,0:51:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖的在车里坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to stay in the car. ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.71,0:51:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈和我马上来 坐好别乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom and I won't be very long. you sit still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.11,0:51:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back in a few minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.84,0:51:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.38,0:51:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 亲爱的 - 恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, honey. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.72,0:51:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走哪边 - 从这边过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- which way was it? - Down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.39,0:51:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,受死吧 你这只癞皮狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that, you scum-sucking dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.42,0:52:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want some candy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.63,0:52:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,布赖恩 布赖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian? brian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.97,0:52:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你立刻给我回来 - 妈咪 我看到鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You come here right this minute! - Mommy, I saw a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.84,0:52:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃糖吗 要吃糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wantsome candy? wantsome candy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.74,0:52:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.91,0:52:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wantsome candy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.18,0:53:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼的项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny's necklace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.81,0:53:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌在繁忙时段坐地铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the subway at rush hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.61,0:53:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时段空位很难找 如果你有幸找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard enough to find a seat, and if you do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.13,0:53:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面要么是有尿的 要么是有屎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's pissed in it or thrown up over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.78,0:53:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,热死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This damn heat is killing me, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.78,0:53:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我上电视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.49,0:53:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很上镜啊 - 臭美\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I look great! - Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.08,0:54:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有签名 大叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No autographs, pop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.66,0:54:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 那儿有两个空位 - 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look. there's two seats right there. - Don't touch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.75,0:54:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.17,0:54:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦事真多\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shit never ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.18,0:54:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来吧 - 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After you. - Asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.01,0:54:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请让开一下 警察办事 - 别挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. police business. - Get out of my way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.10,0:54:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝 亲我一下 来嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby. besame mucho. come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.81,0:54:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去挺有同情心的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like a sympathetic dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.23,0:54:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兄弟最近要做点买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, uh… partner here needs an operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.24,0:54:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们手头有点紧 你明白我意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're a little short of cash, if you know what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.20,0:54:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.12,0:54:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 钱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.53,0:54:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}get the hell away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.45,0:54:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要逼我 我真的会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to use this thing! don't make me use this thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.17,0:54:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌我的枪比你的大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet mine's bigger than yours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.58,0:54:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来搞定他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.38,0:54:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手 警察 - 这次麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold it. police! - We're in trouble now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.13,0:54:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有人都不许动 - 警察 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody move! - Alto, policia, no se muevan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.68,0:54:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家深呼吸 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody take a deep breath, loosen your sphincters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.26,0:55:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逞一时之勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need any rush-hour rambos there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.81,0:55:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下 混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tu tambien, motherfucking baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.73,0:55:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪 然后坐下 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it and sit down! sientate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.27,0:55:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.90,0:55:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂娜 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}leona, you ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.12,0:55:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在车厢里 带乘客们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it! he's in the train! get these people out of here!{\r}
