Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.85,0:55:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.08,0:55:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.07,0:55:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.90,0:55:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.95,0:55:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leona!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.91,0:56:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂娜 带他们走 走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leona, get 'em out! go! go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.75,0:56:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.96,0:56:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.98,0:56:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.82,0:56:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂娜 快走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leona, do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.98,0:56:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.47,0:57:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.26,0:57:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right. come and get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.27,0:57:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走啊 走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! move it! move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.81,0:57:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,走快点 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! vamos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.15,0:57:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.07,0:57:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌 走就可以了 走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't panic, just go! go! vamos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.38,0:57:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你是什么东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus christ. what the fuck are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.30,0:57:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.10,0:57:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊 走啊 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamos!vamos! come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.36,0:58:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前走啊 快 你们两个 走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep walking! come on, you too! vamonos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.86,0:58:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, motherfucker!{\r}
