Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.69,0:58:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 出来 出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, out! out! out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.57,0:58:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.90,0:58:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那边 去有光的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way! that way! towards the light! the light!{\r}
