Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.47,1:00:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 怎么又杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.43,1:00:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开 别挡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, move your ass! move out the way!{\r}
