Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.50,1:00:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的真是一场屠杀 中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fucking slaughter, lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.23,1:00:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.49,1:00:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, jerry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.28,1:00:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, leona! leona!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.53,1:00:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 利昂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. leona… oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.29,1:00:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她怎样了 - 还活着 但过度惊吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- how's she doing? - deep shock, but she's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.83,1:01:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到胎儿的心跳 她怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear foetal heart sounds. she's pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.42,1:01:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻送到洛杉矶医治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move. la county. stat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.63,1:01:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.38,1:01:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,数三下 一 二 三 起\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three. one, two, three. load up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.47,1:01:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.26,1:01:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 快走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out the way! move it! move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.49,1:01:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, wait a minute. let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.13,1:01:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉瑞在哪 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's jerry? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.29,1:01:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了他的警章\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found his badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.09,1:01:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪些人受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who got hit this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.13,1:01:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个小混混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five gang members, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.09,1:01:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}…bunch of commuters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.10,1:01:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.68,1:02:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都有带枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were all armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.56,1:02:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 指挥官的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - It's the chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.44,1:02:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here. yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.19,1:02:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边情况怎么了 - 他妈的很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell's going on down there? - It's a damn nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.42,1:02:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次遇害的都是平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilians this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.69,1:02:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全都死了吗 - 是 和之前的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Allkilled? - Yeah. just like the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.03,1:02:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.16,1:03:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.64,1:03:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼 他妈的发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit! what the hell is going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.73,1:03:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 打开摄像机 快开摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, get the camera on! get the camera on this right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.49,1:03:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍下这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that goddamn thing on film!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.45,1:03:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.96,1:03:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈里根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, harrigan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.71,1:03:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次受害人更多 损毁更严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}More victims! more mutilations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.71,1:03:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去死吧 - 普波\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you! - Pope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.67,1:03:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,普波 你还在吗 普波 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pope? are you there, pope? pope, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.58,1:05:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 那个警察又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the cop is back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.55,1:05:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.84,1:06:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈里根 你就不能省点儿力气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harrigan! don't you show up in the damnedest places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.26,1:06:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 中尉 我有些你会感兴趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, lieutenant. I got something you might find interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.85,1:06:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.31,1:06:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你说多少遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.18,1:06:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道你的对手是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're dealing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.94,1:06:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个就是你要找的凶手 很妙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your killer. wonderful, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.82,1:06:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身躯散发出信息素 即气味分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pheromone signature left by his body. scent molecules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.32,1:06:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开三号监视器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch up three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.58,1:06:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年前 一只同种类的异形在中美洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten years ago one of his kind eliminated an{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.10,1:06:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁了一支特种精英部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elite special forces crew in central america.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.87,1:06:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有两个幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were two survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.96,1:06:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 这种生物一旦被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They indicated that, when trapped, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.87,1:06:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会启动一种自毁程式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creature activated a self-destruct device…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.84,1:06:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,威力足以摧毁三百个街区那么大的雨林\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that destroyed enough rainforest to cover 300 city blocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.05,1:06:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remarkable weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.30,1:06:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 中尉 他是外星生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, lieutenant. other-world life forms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.68,1:06:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.89,1:06:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只他妈的异形\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fucking alien!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.98,1:06:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫磺岛 柬埔寨 贝鲁特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iwo jima, cambodia, beirut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.49,1:07:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,发出热能和引起矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drawn by heat and conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.98,1:07:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在进行着狩猎游戏 狮子 老虎 熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on safari. lions. the tigers. the bears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.99,1:07:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.91,1:07:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖品 那是一场游戏 对吧 凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trophies. that's the game, isn't it, keyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.87,1:07:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是狮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the lion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.66,1:07:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是它的丛林\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is his jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.37,1:07:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么我们看不到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why can't we see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.49,1:07:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它有超强的自卫适应系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}defensive adaptations are astounding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.38,1:07:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能弯曲光线 完美的伪装术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's somehow able to bend light. perfect camouflage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.59,1:07:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你欣赏这只怪物 - 不是它的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you admire the son of a bitch. - not what he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.72,1:07:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是它本身的构造\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.59,1:07:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有它能带给我们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what he can give us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.43,1:07:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将会是科技的一个新时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new era of scientific technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.22,1:07:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生都在等这机会 我不会让它白白溜走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've waited a lifetime for this, and I'm not going to miss the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.19,1:07:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息素雷达扫描仪发现它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have something on the pheromone scanners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.70,1:07:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标在屋顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target one is on the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.41,1:07:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们花了两周的时间摸清了它的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's taken us two weeks to learn his patterns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.66,1:07:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它每隔两天就来这里开餐一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes here every two days to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.87,1:07:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来它很喜欢牛肉 - 我没觉得是素食者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- seems he has a taste for beef. - I didn't think he was vegetarian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.13,1:08:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为这只食肉兽准备了一个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've prepared a trap for this predator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.92,1:08:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定这种生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are certain that this being can see in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.65,1:08:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能用红外线看物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}only one spectrum of light infrared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.99,1:08:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,红外线？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Infrared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.68,1:08:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它靠感应热量捕食\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hunts by seeing our heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.15,1:08:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔绝了热量 它就是瞎子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block the heat and he's blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.76,1:08:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这衣服能隔绝身体的热量 使它看不到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}These suits insulate body heat, making the team invisible to the creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.06,1:08:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在地面上覆盖了一层放射性粉末\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've flooded the place with radioactive dust…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.65,1:08:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,并在每一个角落都安装上强紫外光灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and installed powerful ultraviolet lighting everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.48,1:08:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种粉末粘附在它身上就会使它现形\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dust adheres to his body, making him visible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.49,1:08:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,液氮 你们不是要杀它而是要冰冻它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liquid nitrogen. you're not gonna kill him. you're gonna freeze him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.70,1:08:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要生擒它 - 它在移动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to capture him. - He's moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.95,1:08:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.50,1:08:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个位子 好好看表演吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a seat. enjoy the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.83,1:08:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是历史性的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.89,1:08:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目标是生擒并隔离它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capture and isolation is our objective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.52,1:08:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有在我下令的时候才能防卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defensive action only on my orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.52,1:09:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,开灯 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power up. lights on. let's get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.41,1:09:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.96,1:09:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,切换到紫外线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch to ultraviolet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.08,1:09:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停止通话 - 打开A到J区的紫外线灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Radio silence. out. - engage ultraviolet units a through j.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.11,1:09:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些干扰信号是什么 - 正在调整 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's all this interference? - Correcting the problem, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.77,1:11:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在走向二区\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're moving to the second level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.94,1:11:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标仍在朝二号楼梯井移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target's still moving, heading towards the number two stairwell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.20,1:11:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正在往陷阱里钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing right into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.13,1:11:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.88,1:11:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它停住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.85,1:13:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它退到墙边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's moving back against the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.73,1:13:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正往回走 离他们越来越远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's backing up. it's moving away from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.35,1:13:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人被耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boys have been made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.36,1:13:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 它现在在他们周围兜圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, it's circling around behind them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.70,1:13:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们出来 他们掉进陷阱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em out! they're walking into a trap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.86,1:13:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯 它在三楼 就在你们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keyes, he's behind you. third floor structure. right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.37,1:13:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那里啰嗦 不准通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this? clear the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.83,1:13:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看得见那该死的光 把他们关掉 关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees the damn lights. turn 'em off! turn 'em off! shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.37,1:13:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,制止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.67,1:13:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把门打开 - 你去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Door. open it. - Go fuck yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.01,1:13:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok. ok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.68,1:13:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.10,1:13:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 我开 - 你知道你在做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - You don't know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.72,1:13:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.02,1:13:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会把所有东西搞砸的 - 去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll ruin everything! - Fuck yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.40,1:13:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,防卫队形一 液氮枪关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defensive formation one. nitrogen guns, safeties off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.03,1:13:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else, follow me.{\r}
